message: >-
  Please cite the archived software version used. Version 0.1.0 is publicly
  available through its Zenodo software DOI. This DOI does not identify the
  private real company-year dataset or the unpublished manuscript.
  See CITATION.md for separate upstream-data attribution requirements.
type: software
title: "agb-linkage: Chinese listed-company location and biomass linkage tools"
authors:
  - family-names: Wang
    given-names: Yueyang
    affiliation: Cardiff University
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-10-06"
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23186348
url: https://zenodo.org/records/23186348
repository-code: https://github.com/Jill0099/agb-linkage-software
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Reproducible tools and documentation for auditing and extracting
  local aboveground biomass summaries around company locations.
  The software licence does not grant rights to third-party rasters,
  company-address exports, geocoding responses, or real matched data.
keywords:
  - aboveground biomass
  - geospatial linkage
  - Chinese listed companies
  - reproducibility
